  "body": "* 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms plus a guest toilet\r\n* Approx. 167sqm floor area, 194sqm freehold section\r\n* 1 lounge plus a separate office/study space\r\n* Master suite with walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and private balcony\r\n* Peaceful reserve outlook\r\n* Separate upstairs sitting area\r\n* Central air conditioning\r\n* Underfloor heating in all bathrooms\r\n* Internal-access single garage\r\n* Pre-wired for an EV charger\r\n* 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nEnjoy modern comfort, thoughtful design and a peaceful reserve outlook at 329 Te Taruna Drive. This beautifully presented home offers approximately 167sqm of contemporary living across a low-maintenance 194sqm freehold section, creating an ideal option for families, professionals or anyone seeking an easy-care lifestyle without compromising on comfort.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is designed for relaxed everyday living, with the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forming the heart of the home. Large sliding doors bring in natural light and create an easy connection to the outdoor area, making the space equally suited to quiet evenings at home or entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen combines style and practicality, featuring a generous island, quality benchtop, modern appliances including a built-in microwave, and ample cabinetry for everyday storage. Its central position allows you to stay connected with family and guests while preparing meals.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home provides excellent separation between living and sleeping spaces. The master suite features a walk-in wardrobe, private ensuite and its own balcony overlooking the peaceful reserve - a lovely spot to enjoy the outlook and afternoon sun. The remaining bedrooms are well suited to family, guests or flexible working arrangements, while the additional upstairs sitting area provides valuable extra space for relaxing, reading or working from home.\r\n\r\nComfort has been carefully considered throughout, with central air conditioning and underfloor heating in all bathrooms. A separate office adds further flexibility for those working remotely or needing a dedicated study space.\r\n\r\nCompleting the package is an internal-access single garage, convenient laundry area and pre-wiring for an EV charger. With its low-maintenance design and peaceful reserve setting, this is a home where you can spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying the lifestyle on offer.\r\n\r\nLocated in the growing Milldale community, you'll be within easy reach of local schools, parks, walking tracks, shops and motorway access. Combining modern convenience, flexible living and a tranquil outlook, this is a home ready to be enjoyed from day one.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
